<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Sipef '96 profit up to 235 mln Bfr.</title>
<headline>Belgian Sipef '96 profit up to 235 mln Bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Sales  (billions)		    3.706    vs     3.873</p>
<p>    Current profit			 599.2    vs     583.0</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     627.5    vs     681.8</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 534.1    vs     521.9</p>
<p>    Extraordinary loss		    65.1    vs	61.1</p>
<p>    Cons net profit			333.0    vs     291.7</p>
<p>    Group share net profit	     235.3    vs     157.7</p>
<p>    Net dividend			     140    vs	 130</p>
<p>NOTE - Sipef is a Belgian agricultural commodity company.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
